{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creej's Corruption\u00a0</i>is a <strong><u>Combat Based First-Person Action RPG</u></strong> set in a pre-apocalyptic suburban town. When reuniting with your childhood friend, an ominous building in the distance suddenly collapses causing a massive chain of events. Your friend has been taken. You are the only one who can save him.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/de5ad649a51846658c7b017d1b90f66a.poster.avif?t=1767232609\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/de5ad649a51846658c7b017d1b90f66a.webm?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/de5ad649a51846658c7b017d1b90f66a.mp4?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game features a handcrafted <strong>First-Person Combat system</strong> intended to feel extremely impactful and satisfying. The protagonist, Jeremy, is an ordinary teenager without any  fighting experience. <u><strong>Fights will be brutal and challenging, requiring perfect dodging or parrying in order to survive</strong></u><strong>.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/c2ebbd23e6bf0d0e2b9b4a29f60bf90c.poster.avif?t=1767232609\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/c2ebbd23e6bf0d0e2b9b4a29f60bf90c.webm?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/c2ebbd23e6bf0d0e2b9b4a29f60bf90c.mp4?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br><br>Explore the expansive open world featuring a day night cycle, a weather cycle, multiple biomes, towns, neighborhoods, and enemies who all have their own unique abilities and features. <strong>Embark on a 20+ hour main story with lots of cutscenes, side content, locations, and dangers to find your missing friend and learn the truth! </strong><br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/6d81b3c446a14db7bf5a3cf743702ede.poster.avif?t=1767232609\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/6d81b3c446a14db7bf5a3cf743702ede.webm?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/6d81b3c446a14db7bf5a3cf743702ede.mp4?t=1767232609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420700?t=1767232609","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/4c9d7a89d4f091ccdf074a4014f039d8da2cad17/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767232609","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/c90f421ed8ab3c2a43bfabca586d4466378460ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767232609","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/c90f421ed8ab3c2a43bfabca586d4466378460ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767232609","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creej's Corruption\u00a0</i>is a <strong><u>Combat Based First-Person Action RPG</u></strong> set in a pre-apocalyptic suburban town. 